        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hakaba haroho omurangikati, ibara lye Anna, muhara wa Fanueli ow'omu ruganda rwa Aseeri. Akaba akaikwire muno. Obu yaswirwe, akamara na iba emyaka musanju yonka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.36",
